            "answer": "<p>If your order is still being processed, you can cancel your order by contacting us or by Please include your order number and contact information as well as the reason you would like to cancel the order. Our customer service team will reply to your cancellation request.</p><p>Please note, if you cancel an order after the product has been processed or shipped from our warehouse, you will be responsible for the freight costs (both ways) as well as a 10% restocking fee.</p>"
