            "answer": "<p>Our shipping team packs every order with care, and we have a strong reputation of low instances of damaged shipments.  However, unexpected damage may occur during shipment.   Please email us at <a href=\"mailto:orders@texasbookman.com\" title=\"mailto:orders@texasbookman.com\">orders@texasbookman.com</a> to report the damaged item(s).  Pictures are required for all damaged item(s).  Please<strong> DO NOT</strong> return any item(s) without prior approval from Texas Bookman.  Any items returned without authorization will not be issued credit and will remain on your account. <strong>Any claims for damaged or missing items must be made within 10 days of receipt of order.  </strong></p>"
