            "question": "How will my order ship to U.S.?",
            "answer": "<p>We have very competitive rates with UPS, and a number of freight/LTL companies. If you do not have a preferred shipping method, we will ship your order with the cheapest rate we find . Our preferred parcel carrier is UPS.</p>"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_item_Yx49dh": {
          "type": "_faq-item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How will my order ship internationally (outside of the U.S.)?",
            "answer": "<p>If you are interested in shipping outside of the United States, you must ship your order through a freight forwarder. If you have a freight forwarder in the United States, we will accommodate your requested shipping arrangements. Our preferred method of UK/Europe shipping is Magnum. If you are looking for a freight forwarder, contact us for recommendations.</p><p>Please note that if this is your first time shopping with us, we may require payment by wire transfer or CC prior to your order shipping. <br/><br/></p>"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_item_yNWhr6": {
          "type": "_faq-item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will my order ship?",
            "answer": "<p>Our average processing time for US warehouse orders is 7-10 business days.  Processing times may fluctuate based on Trade Shows, holidays, and number of orders we are receiving.  We process all orders in the order they are received.  If you have a receiving deadline, please inquire before placing your order.  We’ll always try and work with you. </p>"
